# Tailwind CSS v4 Best Practices with Shadcn

## Tailwind CSS v4 Setup

### CSS-first Configuration

**✅ Use `@theme inline` for theming:**

```css
/* src/assets/css/main.css */
@import 'tailwindcss';

@theme inline {
  --radius-sm: calc(var(--radius) - 4px);
  --radius-md: calc(var(--radius) - 2px);
  --radius-lg: var(--radius);
  --color-background: var(--background);
  --color-foreground: var(--foreground);
  --color-card: var(--card);
  --color-primary: var(--primary);
  /* Map all Tailwind utilities to CSS variables */
}
```

**❌ Don't create `tailwind.config.js` for v4:**

```js
// Wrong - Not needed in Tailwind v4
module.exports = {
  theme: {
    extend: {
      colors: { /* custom colors */ }
    }
  }
}
```

### PostCSS Configuration

**Use dedicated Tailwind v4 PostCSS plugin:**

```js
// postcss.config.mjs
export default {
  plugins: {
    "@tailwindcss/postcss": {},
  },
};
```

## Theming Approach

### Customize Shadcn Variables in :root

**✅ Theme customization through shadcn variables:**

```css
:root {
  --radius: 0.625rem;

  /* Your custom theme values */
  --background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50 0%, #34495e 50%, #95a5a6 100%);
  --foreground: #ffffff;
  --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  --card-foreground: #ffffff;
  --primary: #ffffff;
  --primary-foreground: #2c3e50;
  --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  --input: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  --muted-foreground: #dfe6e9;
  --ring: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
}
```

**❌ Don't create separate theme classes:**

```css
/* Wrong - Creates additional complexity */
.glassmorphism-theme {
  --custom-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  --custom-text: #ffffff;
}
```

## Component Styling

### Use Shadcn Semantic Classes

**✅ Always use semantic Tailwind classes:**

```tsx
// Correct - Semantic and themeable
<div className='bg-card text-card-foreground border-border rounded-lg' />
<button className='bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90' />
<input className='bg-input border-input text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground' />
```

**❌ Avoid hardcoded values or custom properties:**

```tsx
// Wrong - Hardcoded colors
<div className='bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] text-[#ffffff]' />

// Wrong - Custom variables
<div className='bg-[var(--custom-glass-bg)] text-[var(--custom-text)]' />
```

## Layout & Components

### Background Styling

**✅ Use `bg-background` with custom pattern:**

```tsx
// Use shadcn background class
<div className='bg-background min-h-screen'>
  {/* Your content */}
</div>
```

```css
/* Add patterns/effects in @layer components */
@layer components {
  .bg-background {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .bg-background::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,...");
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
}
```

### Responsive Design

**Use mobile-first approach with consistent breakpoints:**

```tsx
<div className='w-full max-w-sm md:max-w-md lg:max-w-lg xl:max-w-xl'>
  <div className='p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8'>
    <h1 className='text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl'>
      Title
    </h1>
  </div>
</div>
```

## Performance & Organization

### Minimize Custom CSS

**✅ Use Tailwind utilities and shadcn classes:**
- Leverage built-in utility classes
- Customize through CSS variables, not new classes
- Use CVA for component variants

**❌ Avoid creating many custom CSS classes:**
```css
/* Wrong - Too many custom classes */
.custom-button { /* ... */ }
.custom-input { /* ... */ }
.custom-card { /* ... */ }
```

### File Organization

**Structure CSS following v4 conventions:**

```css
/* main.css structure */
@import 'tailwindcss';

@theme inline {
  /* Theme mappings */
}

:root {
  /* Shadcn variable customizations */
}

.dark {
  /* Dark mode overrides */
}

@layer components {
  /* Minimal component-specific utilities */
}
```

## Accessibility & Best Practices

1. **Use semantic HTML with Tailwind classes**
2. **Ensure proper color contrast** with shadcn variables
3. **Test with screen readers** and keyboard navigation
4. **Use `focus-visible:` utilities** for keyboard focus styling
5. **Implement `hover:` and `active:` states** consistently
6. **Follow WCAG guidelines** for interactive elements
